/**
 * @defgroup MCC_Rhythm Rhythm
 * @ingroup MCC
 * @brief Exact written durations, independent of playback time.
 *
 * MCC::NoteValue records a power-of-two note base and its augmentation dots.
 * MCC::Note combines that exact value with a spelling-preserving MCC::Pitch.
 * MCC::Meter preserves a written time signature and derives simple or
 * compound beats without guessing irregular groupings. MCC::RhythmPattern
 * records which steps of a cyclic grid are onsets, in the box and
 * interonset-interval notations of Toussaint's *The Geometry of Musical
 * Rhythm*. None depends on tempo, clocks, PPQN or MIDI.
 */
